Date: Tue, 15 Sep 2026 18:43:54 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] Rework About page: navy "How we work" band, 75+ figure,
 drop Penang from copy, full-bleed footer

- "How we work" section now uses the same dark navy as the About hero
  (scoped to this page only via a new .section-band-navy modifier, so
  Careers' blue "Find your discipline" band is untouched)
- Hero badge and body copy engineer figure updated from 30+ to 75+ to
  match the homepage counter
- Removed "Penang" from marketing/positioning copy (meta description,
  hero lede, hero badge, intro paragraphs, "Our Penang presence"
  heading, which is now "Where to find us") per direction from the
  boss to stop foregrounding one location. Left it in the literal
  mailing address, map embed, and footer, since that's the real
  office address rather than positioning language.
- Footer container is now full-bleed (no left/right gutter), site-wide
  since the footer markup is shared across all pages

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01SjcntVjf5Nr2bdomgFdfPu
